Value Filldown SHELF (\d+)
Value Filldown SLOT (\d+|\S+)
Value BOARD_TYPE (\S+)
Value I2C (\d+)
Value ADDR (\d+)
Value Required DESCRIPTION (.*?)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value MINOR (-?\d+)
Value MAJOR (-?\d+)
Value FATAL (-?\d+)
Value OVERHEAT (-?\d+)
Value TEMPERATURE (-?\d+)

Start
  ^\s*\[shelf ${SHELF},\s+(?:slot\s+)?${SLOT}\]
  ^${BOARD_TYPE}\s+${I2C}\s+${ADDR}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s+${STATUS}\s+${MINOR}\s+${MAJOR}\s+${FATAL}\s+${OVERHEAT}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^ENV\s+${STATUS}\s+${OVERHEAT}\s+${MINOR}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s*$$ -> Record
